# package-lock.json is COMMITTED again as of 2026-11-20. It was deleted in
# July 2026 to dodge npm pruning optionalDependencies to the installing host -
# a Windows-generated lockfile omits the Linux-only platform packages the
# build needs, which took yojana-app down on 2026-09-30. That trade cost
# reproducible builds: every deploy re-resolved from scratch.
# .github/workflows/lockfile-refresh.yml removes the trade by generating the
# lockfile on ubuntu-latest. Never regenerate it on Windows.

# Build output (Astro-era leftovers + Next). Untracked but not ignored before,
# which let a `git add -A` sweep them into a commit once.
dist/
.astro/
.wrangler/
